@base = https://localhost:7240
@csrf = obtain-from-api-auth-csrf
@windowId = replace-with-window-id
@memberId = replace-with-member-id
@railwayId = replace-with-railway-id
@locomotiveId = replace-with-locomotive-id
@dutyId = replace-with-duty-id
@assignmentId = replace-with-assignment-id

### Use an HTTP client that retains cookies. Fetch a new CSRF token after login/password change.
GET {{base}}/api/auth/csrf

### Sign in (copy csrf response token above)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"email":"admin@example.org","password":"your-temporary-password"}

### After login: fetch /api/auth/csrf again, then change the temporary password
POST {{base}}/api/auth/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"currentPassword":"your-temporary-password","newPassword":"your-new-long-password"}

### Current account
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me

### Administrator creates a member (password must have upper/lower case, digit and symbol)
POST {{base}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"email":"member@example.org","displayName":"Example Member","temporaryPassword":"Replace-this-password-123!","roles":["Member"]}

### Open a calendar month (adjust dates and deadline)
POST {{base}}/api/windows
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"October 2030","kind":"Monthly","start":"2030-10-01","end":"2030-10-31","submissionDeadlineUtc":"2030-09-30T22:59:00Z"}

### Signed-in member supplies availability; omitted dates keep their existing values
PUT {{base}}/api/me/availability/{{windowId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{
  "maximumAssignments":4,
  "days":[
    {"date":"2030-10-07","status":"Available","from":null,"until":null,"preferredRole":null,"note":null},
    {"date":"2030-10-08","status":"Available","from":"10:00:00","until":"16:00:00","preferredRole":"Driver","note":"Prefer driving if possible"}
  ]
}

### Create reference data (administrator)
POST {{base}}/api/railways
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Museum Railway"}

### Create a locomotive (administrator)
POST {{base}}/api/locomotives
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Locomotive A"}

### Define element (assessor); set elementId to the returned id
POST {{base}}/api/competence-elements
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Railway A driving","description":"Theory and practical driving assessment","learningType":"TheoryAndPractical","reassessmentMonths":12}

### Define role (assessor); set competenceRoleId to the returned id
POST {{base}}/api/competence-roles
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Railway A driver","category":"Driver","railwayId":"{{railwayId}}","locomotiveId":"{{locomotiveId}}","elementIds":["{{elementId}}"]}

### Record assessment (assessor); use an actual past/current assessment date
POST {{base}}/api/element-assessments
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"memberId":"{{memberId}}","elementId":"{{elementId}}","outcome":"Competent","assessedOn":"2026-09-23","evidence":"Practical assessment completed; reference AS-001"}

### Create a single-role duty (planner)
POST {{base}}/api/duties
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Operating day driver","competenceRoleId":"{{competenceRoleId}}","date":"2030-10-07","start":"09:00:00","end":"17:00:00","role":"Driver","railwayId":"{{railwayId}}","locomotiveId":"{{locomotiveId}}"}

### Assign qualified, available member (planner)
POST {{base}}/api/duties/{{dutyId}}/assignment
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"memberId":"{{memberId}}"}

### Publish after rechecking all rules
POST {{base}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/publish
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Planner sees assignments and current conflicts
GET {{base}}/api/roster?from=2030-10-01&until=2030-10-31

### Member sees only their published assignments
GET {{base}}/api/me/roster?from=2030-10-01&until=2030-10-31
